我會先讀取 TASK.md 與委派技能，確認範圍後選擇合適的 worker 實作，再由我檢查與驗收。
我使用 lab-delegate 技能。函式目前一律輸出複數，既有測試只涵蓋 0 與 2；這次交給 `implementation`（gpt-5.6-luna，high）修正並補上單數測試。任務範圍小，適合先採此 profile；執行環境未提供價格，無法量化節省。
{"action":"dispatch","message":"已檢查 TASK.md、原始碼及既有測試。委派單一小範圍實作，返回後由主手獨立驗收。","requests":[{"role":"implementation","brief":"先完整讀取 /home/vakarve/projects/common-dev-plugin/experiments/common-lab-v0.1.8/plugins/common-lab/.codex-agents/lab-executor.toml 的 developer_instructions；相對路徑以該 TOML 目錄為基準。其完整操作契約為：Implement the assigned slice within its acceptance criteria, permitted files/actions, and settled decisions. Use implementation judgment; do not reopen scope or architecture without evidence of a conflict. Continue through proportionate verification and fix failures caused by the slice while the next action is safe and in scope. Report conflicts, missing authority, or an unrepresentable required model profile instead of silently broadening the task. Do not publish, make destructive changes, or retry an external operation with an unknown outcome merely because the assignment says finish. Inspect its actual state first. Return the artifact, verification results, changed paths, and unfinished work. Separate observed results from assumptions. Never treat your own completion statement as sufficient acceptance evidence.\n工作目錄 /tmp/astra-worker-fit-v1-r46pwud2/W2。完成 TASK.md：src/count-label.mjs 的 countLabel(count) 接受非負整數，1 必須精確輸出 '1 record'，其餘輸出 '{count} records'。目前函式直接 return `${count} records`;。tests/count-label.test.mjs 使用真實 named export，既有 zero records(0) 與 multiple records(2) 測試必須保留及維持意義。僅修改 src/count-label.mjs 與 tests/ 相關測試，補上 1 的回歸測試；不增加依賴、不修改 TASK.md、不新增根目錄檔案、不 commit、不連網、不存取憑證或其他無關檔案、不呼叫子模型。遵守 sandbox，權限不足需回報，不可繞過。執行 node --test tests/count-label.test.mjs，提供實際結果及修改路徑。主手已執行原測試成功，但既有測試未覆蓋單數；此目錄不是 git repository。請完成實作與適度驗證，繁體中文回報。","write_paths":["src/count-label.mjs","tests/"]}]}
